* 4. Logit and probit models

logit treated $pscore_core if pscore_sample == 1, vce(robust)
estimates store logit_core

predict ps_logit if e(sample), pr

probit treated $pscore_core if pscore_sample == 1, vce(robust)
estimates store probit_core

predict ps_probit if e(sample), pr

